0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Made by hand for booklet_edit_probe's settings that stay with their step.
0 // Seven steps of the model's own, each two 2 x 2 bricks of one colour side by
0 // side on the ground, none standing on another, so any step can go earlier or
0 // later: red, blue, yellow, green (which also puts the pair on the green
0 // bricks), white, black, orange. The pair is a sub-model built in steps of
0 // its own, a callout: two 2 x 2 bricks side by side, one a step, so either
0 // can go first, and a 2 x 4 plate across them.
